% B3-CODE: DEFECT 6, THE CODE WINDOW.  R8 IS 27C00, SO W^ CALLS REACH
% 1FC00-2FBFF, AND THE FIXUP VECTOR (ISD 7) STARTS AT 2FC00.  W2 FITS
% BELOW 2FC00; W1'S CODE DOES NOT.
HEX
"CODE_PNTR " MSG CODE_PNTR @ <#> TYPE CR
2FBF0 CODE_PNTR !
'W2 : 77 ;
'W2 WHERE CR
"W2 " MSG W2 = CR
"CODE_PNTR " MSG CODE_PNTR @ <#> TYPE CR
'W1 : 1 2 + 3 4 + 5 6 + 7 8 + + + + ;
"AFTER W1" MSG CR
